Package: trackeye
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-opencv, python3-numpy
Recommends: xdotool
Maintainer: TrackEye Contributors <trackeye@localhost>
Description: Eye & micro-gesture control for Ubuntu
 TrackEye controls the computer with eye gaze and facial micro-gestures
 (blink, head tilt) using only the local webcam. All video processing
 happens on-device; the application uses no network.
 Optimized for always-on use with dynamic FPS and local profiles,
 quick calibration, dwell/blink click, Scan & Select and training.
